@Ordo.Orders.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142

### Health
GET {{Ordo.Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Create an order
POST {{Ordo.Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-7111-8111-111111111111",
  "currency": "USD",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "22222222-2222-7222-8222-222222222222", "quantity": 2, "unitPriceMinor": 999 }
  ]
}

### Read an order (replace with the id returned above)
GET {{Ordo.Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/orders/33333333-3333-7333-8333-333333333333
Accept: application/json
